co de auto-corrección..."); } } } if (!$testsPassed) { $this->transitionTo(WorkflowState::FAILED, "La suite de pruebas continuó fallando tras {$this->maxRetries} intentos."); return [ 'workflow_id' => $this->workflowId, 'status' => WorkflowState::FAILED, 'error' => "Pruebas unitarias no superadas." ]; } $this->transitionTo(WorkflowState::SECURITY_CHECK, "Ejecutando agente de seguridad SAST"); $secReportFile = $this->runPythonAgent('security'); $this->transitionTo(WorkflowState::E2E_CHECK, "Ejecutando verificaciones sintéticas E2E"); $this->runPythonAgent('e2e'); $this->transitionTo(WorkflowState::DOCUMENTING, "Actualizando documentación del proyecto"); $this->runPythonAgent('documentation'); $this->transitionTo(WorkflowState::REVIEWING, "Realizando revisión final unificada"); $finalMarkdown = "# Reporte Final de Orquestación de IA\n\n" . "- **Workflow ID**: {$this->workflowId}\n" . "- **Objetivo**: {$userGoal}\n" . "- **Evaluación de Riesgo**: {$risk['level']}\n" . "- **Estado Pruebas**: OK\n" . "- **Auditoría de Seguridad**: COMPLETADA\n" . "- **Estado Final**: COMPLETED\n"; $this->report->saveFinalReport($finalMarkdown); $this->transitionTo(WorkflowState::COMPLETED, "Workflow completado con éxito"); return [ 'workflow_id' => $this->workflowId, 'status' => WorkflowState::COMPLETED, 'goal' => $userGoal, 'risk' => $risk['level'], 'report_file' => "storage/reports/workflows/{$this->workflowId}/final-report.md" ]; } private function runPythonAgent(string $agentName): string { $cmd = "python3 " . escapeshellarg(__DIR__ . '/../../../agents/core/orchestrator.py') . " " . escapeshellarg($agentName); exec($cmd); return __DIR__ . '/../../../storage/reports/' . $agentName . 'agent_report.json'; } } 